== 版本

== 1) 书里的 .../toggle 端点
toggle_http=404
== 2) 实际可用的 /on
on_http=200
{"name":"development","enabled":false}
{"name":"production","enabled":true}
== 3) 建 client token
default:production.44a818fcbb7c68f92d21eaff16cdd8c007f2645a97ecdb992346638d
== 4) /off
off_http=200
{"name":"development","enabled":false}
{"name":"production","enabled":false}
== 5) 打开后，客户端 API 求值（client token）
{"name":"checkout.v2","enabled":true}
== 6) 关闭后
{"name":"checkout.v2","enabled":false}
